# Language Test 202505 - ABC088B: Card Game for Two
Sonome kas N tas Kisite kas readint.
Sonome kas A tas Kisite kas reverse vis (Kisite kas paline vis (Kisite kas readints vis N)).
Sonome kas alice tas 0.
Sonome kas bob tas 0.
Pilike kas i pas Kisite kas pilika vis N {
    Palusta i % 2 kate 0 {
        alice += A[i].
    } Japalusta {
        bob += A[i].
    }
}
Takute kas alice - bob.
